      "output": "I'll start by exploring the codebase to verify the ticket's claims before writing the plan.\nNow let me read the test file and the docs to verify claims.\nNow let me read the docs and package.json.\nLet me verify how `runHeadless`'s return value maps to the process exit code, and check the constants/style conventions.\nI have everything verified. Let me check for a stale remainder file and confirm the `.plans`/`.attractor` dirs.\nAll claims verified. Now I'll write the plan and sidecar files.\nNow the sidecar files:\nPlan and sidecars written. Summary of what I produced:\n\n**Plan:** `.plans/AI-3109-reserved-exit-codes.md`\n\nI verified every ticket claim against the real code before planning:\n- `executePreparedHeadlessPlan` derivation at `src/headless-run.ts:246-273` (spawn-error path emitting `1`, and `resultIsError && childExitCode === 0 ? 1 : childExitCode`) — confirmed.\n- The preflight catch at `src/headless-run.ts:108-112` returning `1` — confirmed it funnels *all* pre-execution throws.\n- `process.exitCode = await runHeadless(...)` at `src/main.ts:141` — confirmed the return value **is** the process exit code, and that the emitted `run.completed.exitCode` already equals it in every path.\n- The passthrough proof tests (`exitCode` `7` at `:1141`; `128 + SIGTERM` at `:1180`) — confirmed present; the plan explicitly forbids touching them.\n- `src/` + `package.json` are release-affecting → version bump required.\n\n**Design decision:** reserved contiguous block `64` (preflight/usage), `65` (spawn failure), `66` (semantic harness failure), mirroring `sysexits.h`. The only three edits are three literal `1` → constant swaps; the `childExitCode` derivation and `resultIsError` computation stay byte-for-byte, which is exactly what keeps the passthrough/`128+signal` invariant intact.\n\n**Three independently-committable tasks:** (1) code + test edits, (2) docs (README table, DESIGN mirror, qa doc), (3) version bump `0.11.0 → 0.12.0`.\n\n**Sidecars:** `.attractor/ac.json` (all 3 ticket ACs, status null) and `.attractor/plan-meta-draft.json` (6 files, all edits). The whole ticket fits the budget (one authored source/test unit + 4 docs/config edits), so no `.attractor/plan-remainder.json` was created — none existed to delete.\n",
